id: minimal-healing
name: Minimal Healing
restriction: true
reduction: 5
locked: Healing Expertise, Overexertion
# "You do not increase the amount of Life Points regained by your Magic Modifier."
healNoModifier: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Healing Hands does not add your Magic Modifier.
text: >
  Minimal Healing: You aren’t able to heal as much damage as most.
  –Locked Advancements: Healing Expertise, Overexertion
  –TP Cost: -5
  –Effect: You do not increase the amount of Life Points regained by your Magic Modifier.
